# Line endings if this folder is later put under git (for example on Windows with core.autocrlf=true):
# text files stay LF, as shipped (PACKAGE_MANIFEST.txt and offline_packages\OFFLINE_MANIFEST.json record byte-level
# SHA-256 hashes, for example of requirements.lock); CMD scripts stay CRLF; binary files are never converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.parquet binary
*.whl binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
